<title>PERU: Edegel Q1 net profit doubles.</title>
<headline>Edegel Q1 net profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - n.a.</p>
<p>Net - 79.54 million soles vs 39.78 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 109.25 million soles vs 97.62 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Edegel, privatized in 1995, is controlled by a consortium consisting of U.S. company Entergy Corp, Chile's Endesa and local companies Grana y Montero and Banco Wiese.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
